## Per-skill sign-off checklist

Copy this into the session's tracking (Asana subtask, PR description, or
`examples/README.md`) for each skill before marking it done:

```
Skill: ___________________

[ ] Layer 1 — Trigger test run via skill-creator, description optimized,
    held-out test rate: ____%
[ ] Layer 2 — Dry run on real input completed, output saved to examples/
[ ] Layer 3 — Cold read completed, output matched Output Format with no
    outside context needed
[ ] SKILL.md follows templates/skill-template.md structure
[ ] README.md present and follows templates/readme-template.md
[ ] Prerequisites section follows the MCP dependency policy above
    (Claude-only unless explicitly justified otherwise)
```

A skill that hasn't checked all six boxes isn't done, regardless of how
finished the SKILL.md prose reads.
